{"type":"npc","name":"Mirthless","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":56,"temp":0,"max":56,"details":""},"ac":{"value":22,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["aklo","common","fey","venenan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":5},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Once members of bands of wicked pranksters, the mirthless no longer cackle with malicious glee. Instead, they sob into their jeweled goblets, overcome by bitter regrets. The tears of these cruel and cunning fencers are poisonous to mind and body alike, infesting whoever is afflicted with them with the mirthless's bitter despair.</p><p>Mirthless spin tales of woe to each other and all that approach. They patiently listen to anyone who shares their own regrets and sorrows. If those regrets are tinged with jealousy, such as tales of people who envy the current partner of a former lover or who covet a long-desired accolade that went to a rival instead, the mirthless might offer more than simply words of commiseration. They fuel those feelings of jealousy and help their partner in despair enact elaborate plots of revenge. It matters not to the mirthless whether the plots succeed or fail so long as they can revel in someone's misery.</p><p>Mirthless can't stand being alone. They are most often encountered in the company of others of their kind, typically members of their former prankster bands or others with whom they have shared particularly unpleasant experiences. Anyone who smiles, laughs, or shares tales and songs of happiness in the presence of a mirthless inspires the fey to violent rage.</p><h2>Cheer Up Mate!</h2><p>Helping a mirthless overcome their sadness is a difficult, though not always impossible, task. A mirthless is all too eager to share its tale of woe with anyone who will listen—the trick seems to be convincing them that feeling joy again is even possible. Often, those seeking to help a mirthless must leave the fey to wallow in their sorrow while the tragic events that caused them to become a mirthless are put right. A mirthless who reclaims their zest for life is no less mischievous than they once were, but their tears become those of boundless bliss that instill a wild exuberance in anyone who tastes them.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 18/45/80 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (light, medium), skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Deception, Nature, Performance, Stealth, Thievery)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, dexterity, energy resistant (vitality), poison, poisonous armor, sensory (low-light vision), wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Don Gadberry","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":2},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":4},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":11,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":9,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":12,"special":[]},"athletics":{"base":11,"special":[{"label":"to Trip","predicate":["action:trip"],"base":13}]},"deception":{"base":13,"special":[]},"nature":{"base":11,"special":[]},"performance":{"base":13,"special":[]},"stealth":{"base":13,"special":[]},"thievery":{"base":12,"special":[]}},"traits":{"value":["fey"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"sm"}}},"_id":"jUiUSoVJuv4SI0Jj","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/mirthless.webp","prototypeToken